<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rainbow Chicken half year loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Rainbow Chicken half year loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib loss (cts)  44.6	vs 15.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		    -	  vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib loss		 164.4     vs 57.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		164.4     vs 55.6</p>
<p>    Tax			    -	  vs 0.2</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     56.4	vs 32.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    987.7     vs 880.8</p>
<p>Full name: Rainbow Chicken Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company warned in August that it faced a 165 million rand loss in the six months to September 30.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
